{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119312","id":3644015479,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ZM0N3","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119312","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119312.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119312.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119312","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119312/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119312/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119312/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ca475b9a356e803398f7741bfe805170af54f921","number":119312,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix various accessibility issues in `PopupMenu`","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #119050.\r\nFixes #119311.\r\n\r\nThis does a number of things to try to fix accessibility for `PopupMenu` (and `EditorResourcePicker` as a result):\r\n\r\n1. Removes the hiding of search bar focus when the `PopupMenu` is first opened.\r\n1. Fixes the sizing and positioning of the accessibility region (mostly through trial-and-error).\r\n1. Excludes hidden items from being included in the total item count.\r\n1. Sets `AccessibilityFlags::FLAG_HIDDEN` based on the value of `Item::visible`.\r\n1. Allows `ui_up`/`ui_down` to release focus from the search bar, allowing narration of the menu items when the search bar is enabled.\r\n1. Removed `PopupMenu::_search_bar_input`, since it's not needed if we're releasing focus from the search bar on `ui_up`/`ui_down`.\r\n1. Added `PopupMenu::_search_bar_focus_entered` to deselect any selected item when the search bar gains focus again.\r\n\r\nRemaining issues:\r\n\r\n1. ~~Positioning of accessibility region is still borked for submenus.~~\r\n    - Dealt with in #119328.\r\n1. Scaling a parent `Node2D` still results in borked sizing/positioning of the accessibility region.\r\n1. ~~`ui_focus_next`/`ui_focus_prev` does nothing when search bar is focused.~~\r\n    - Dealt with by enabling `FOCUS_ALL` on `control` and changing it to be a new `PopupMenuItems` class that forward `get_focused_accessibility_element` to `PopupMenu`.\r\n\r\n---\r\n_Disclaimer: AI tooling was used to help triage parts of this, as well as make some minor edits, as part of #118571. Any code not physically typed out by myself has been carefully reviewed to the best of my ability._","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNz